              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Blattla is a simplified Bavarian point-trick game for four players, usually played in temporary partnerships."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Blattla is a Bavarian regional game for four players and belongs to the Schafkopf and Bierkopf environment. It is documented as a simplified local point-trick form, usually played in temporary partnerships with a 32-card German pack."
            }
          ]
        },
